{
    "id": "isaacs-hb-pf2e",
    "title": "Isaac's Homebrew (PF2e): The Saint and The Soulbound",
    "description": "<p>Homebrew content for the Pathfinder Second Edition system. <strong>The Saint</strong>, a martial focus-user whose power answers to the sky: twelve Gold Cloths with four Techniques each, and a sky tracker that decides whose day it is. <strong>The Soulbound</strong>, a martial focus-user whose pool refills by fighting: three Lineages, fifteen Spirits with four-rung release ladders, the Kidō list, and a capstone that takes your powers when it is done.</p>",
    "version": "99.0.0",
